:''This article is about the Cat Unit. For the enemy, see [[Pokota (Enemy)]].''
'''Pokota''' is a [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rare Cat]] that was added in [[Version 7.0 Update|Version 7.0]] and can be acquired as a [[Timed Stage Reward]] when completing [[Rabbit's Mischief]] with a score of 5,000 or more during the [[LINE Pokopang! Collaboration Event]].

{{Cat Info
|ID = 419
|rarity = RR
|name1 = Pokota
|name2 = Pokota CC
}}

==Evolution==
Evolves into '''Pokota CC''' at level 10.

==Strategy/Usage==
This bunny has no meaning or use in the game other than to boost [[User Rank]]. The best it can do is offer some support in early [[Empire of Cats]] stages like [[Korea (Empire of Cats)|Korea]] or [[Japan (Empire of Cats)|Japan]], as it will falter and die to any real threat, like [[Dark Emperor Nyandam]]. Unfortunately, no amount of boost will save it from this fate either, as its base stats are too low.

{{Job|Classification = User Rank Dump}}

